WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.950
The Shadow stood in the middle of the core, wearing a cloak of red light.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.870
Behind it, Sila's robots stood in rows.

3
00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:12.950
Twenty-Three. Didn't they tell you the truth? You are my copy.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.440
You're lying. Doctor Ekin, tell it!

5
00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:21.660
The Shadow was the first attempt, AyShe. You are the finished one.

6
00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.210
The two of you were born from the same DNA.

7
00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.330
AyShe's knees trembled.

8
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:30.270
The enemy she had chased for years was actually her own shadow.

9
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:33.320
It doesn't matter who you are, AyShe.

10
00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:37.120
What matters is what you do. And you have always protected us.

11
00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:41.050
She's right. You're no copy. You're our leader.

12
00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:43.310
The robots attacked.

13
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.960
Mony raised the shield, Mira covered the floor with ice.

14
00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:50.160
Slide away! Welcome to the ice rink!

15
00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.160
The robots slipped on the ice one after another.

16
00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:56.240
But the Shadow was walking toward the crystal heart.

17
00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:00.620
Just then, a red cape leapt in front of it. It was Nyra.

18
00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:04.350
Take one more step and my sword is yours.

19
00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.890
Nyra. So even Sila's crimson warrior betrays us.

20
00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:13.900
I betrayed no one. I've finally chosen the right side.

21
00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:15.640
The Shadow stepped back.

22
00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:19.900
But as it left, it tore a small piece off the crystal heart.

23
00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:23.630
Hey! Give that piece back! That's the doctor's heart!

24
00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:26.980
The Shadow vanished into red smoke.

25
00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:29.400
That piece is the key to the capsules.

26
00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:33.350
The Shadow wants to replace the sleepers with its own copies.

27
00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:37.520
AyShe clenched her fists. Now she knew what to do.

28
00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:42.530
Then we'll move before it does. No one touches our brothers and sisters.

